---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Qark Energy collects, uses and protects personal information." updated="3 October 2026">
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We collect the information you send us directly, such as your name, email address, organisation and message when
    you write to us, ask for updates or apply for a role. Our contact form does not store anything: it opens your own
    email app with the message for you to send. Our hosting provider may log basic technical information, such as IP
    address and browser type, to operate and secure the site.
  </p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to inquiries and provide requested information</li>
    <li>To evaluate job applications</li>
    <li>To send updates you have subscribed to</li>
    <li>To operate, secure and improve this website</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations, including export control requirements</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell personal information. We share it only with service providers who process it on our behalf under
    contract, or where required by law.
  </p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain personal information only as long as needed for the purposes described above or as required by law.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under applicable law, including India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you may have rights to access,
    correct or erase your personal information. To exercise these rights, contact
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email.privacy}`}>{site.email.privacy}</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>See our <a href={withBase('/cookie')}>Cookie Notice</a> for details on the cookies this site uses.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page reflects the latest revision.</p>
</LegalLayout>
